WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.150
Someone once said:

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:53.120
There is a salmon with the 
smell of rich mushrooms,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.220
a full course of autumn flavors...

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.260
The Musalmoroom!

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:04.730
There is a myna bird with sweet 
wings of the finest adzuki jelly...

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:08.600
The Mynadzuki!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.870
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:16.610
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.210
The Amusement Park of Eating!

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.880
The Bellyfull City, Gourmet Town!

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.360
Komatsu, you've never been here before?

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:36.430
Right...

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.070
I decided to come only after 
I'd made it in the world.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:40.530
After you made it?

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.040
You're the chef of a 5-star hotel...

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:49.280
But this town has the highest, 10-star 
rated restaurants in the Gourmet Tower!

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.480
I'm barely halfway to having really made it!

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.780
But aren't you glad you came?

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.620
Well, since you invited me, Toriko-san...

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:01.990
But, why are you coming 
to Gourmet Town again?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.520
Oh, about that...

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.260
Komatsu?

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:11.630
So this is the Bellyfull City, Gourmet Town?

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.940
That's it, right? Gourmet Tower!

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.010
Yup.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.880
Gourmet Tower, where you can 
taste food from around the world.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.180
The upper floors are mostly 
10-star restaurants

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.320
that won't even let new faces in the door.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:34.020
Well, with my introduction, I'm 
sure you could get in, Komatsu.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.790
R-Really?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.460
I've got no business in the tower 
though, so maybe next time.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:41.060
Aww...

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:42.930
It's been so long since 
I've been to a big city!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.100
Yeah, it's been way too long!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.200
Um, isn't this the first 
time we've been to a city?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.900
We've been to a bunch in RPGs...

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.700
That's in a video game.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:53.870
Tong-san!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.870
Not tong, Zonge!

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:56.840
It's you!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.680
How dare you leave me like 
that in the Wu Jungle!

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:02.610
I was so concerned about 
the Woolstar Sauce fruit

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.780
that I completely forgot you were there!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.580
I'm sorry...

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.550
That's just cruel, man.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:10.450
What's that?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:12.290
That threatening presence...

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:40.020
Is everyone still not assembled?

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:44.190
Vice Chief Cook Grinpatch-sama, 
Tommyrod-sama,

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.490
and First Branch Chairman 
Elg are not here yet.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.730
The only one of the Vice Chief Cooks 
that wasn't late was Starjun-sama.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.500
I feel for all the trouble they're 
causing you, Kuromado-sama.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:00.570
Chief Chef, we are here to discuss the 
failure to capture the Jewel Meat, yes?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:04.370
I take full responsibility.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.210
No, it was the fault of the 
GT Robot's capabilities.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.850
The robot did not project enough 
of your power, Starjun-sama.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.620
Seriously...

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:21.060
You gotta increase the capacity, 
or I can't get the job done right.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:24.390
You used the robot's abilities to the fullest

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.490
and you still lost completely 
to Sunny, Cedre-sama.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.360
Shut up, Joe Joe!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.930
It was not a problem with 
the robot's capabilities.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.500
It was because I tested Toriko's power.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.920
Grinpatch-sama!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:55.390
I totally understand wanting 
to test Toriko's abilities!

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:59.090
The increase of his abilities after 
his cells crossed the threshold

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.460
was extremely high.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.300
Look what he did to my straw!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:08.230
One day I think he might be able 
to go to the Gourmet World.

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:11.100
Grin, you encountered Toriko?

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:16.380
And what about the recovery of the GT Robot?

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.750
Didn't find that thing anywhere.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:24.350
But I captured some BB Corn instead!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.920
So be it.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:31.660
Letting the Jewel Meat slip from 
our grasp is a painful setback.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:36.130
Once the Gourmet Cells inside our 
bodies grow to a certain level,

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.460
they will surely hit a barrier.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:43.130
When they burst through the 
barrier, the cells will evolve.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.240
The Jewel Meat was an ingredient 
that could destroy that barrier.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:53.040
If we had obtained it, perhaps more 
of the members of the Gourmet Corp.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:56.210
would be able to enter the Gourmet World.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:01.390
Entering the Gourmet World 
means getting closer to GOD,

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:05.060
which will one day show 
itself in the Gourmet World.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.790
GOD! The ingredient that stands 
atop all others in this world,

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.630
the possession of which means 
rule over all ingredients!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:16.400
The Jewel Meat is not the only 
ingredient that can break the barrier!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.730
Search out others!

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.770
Search so that our boss can get GOD,

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.270
and rule over the ingredients 
of the entire world!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.180
Search for the ultimate gourmet ingredients!

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:29.780
If I may... There is an 
ingredient that interests me...

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.680
Oh? And what ingredient might that be?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.950
A soup, melted from the ice continent...

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:43.090
Checking your Gourmet ID.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.230
An identity check before entering the city?

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.770
Want something to drink?

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.240
I'm thirsty...

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.800
My treat.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.900
Sure about that?

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.570
Those are 3-star vending machines.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:01.180
100,000?! That's pricey!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.150
The more stars, the more 
valuable the drinks it sells.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.720
Is it really okay to just 
leave such expensive drinks

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.690
and ingredients on the street like this?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.560
That's why there's a very 
tight security system.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.160
Let go of me!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:19.330
What's the Gourmet ID thing?! 
I never heard of that crap!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.660
If you don't have a card, 
please pay the entrance fee!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:26.830
Entrance fee? Who the hell do 
you think I am, you bumpkin!

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.840
Komatsu, come over here.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.140
This vending machine without 
any stars is nice and cheap.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.180
10 yen?! That's super cheap!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.910
And the sizes are huge!

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.230
As expected from the Bellyfull 
City, Gourmet Town!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.230
Yeah, actually my belly's already full...

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.270
Even carrying this is tough...

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:01.700
Come on by!

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.870
I've got Mystery Bird Gerold kebabs here!

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.670
Ooh, looks delicious!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.510
Toriko, want a plate?

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.510
What, a plate you say?!

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.640
Thanks for this food!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.720
Yum!

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:18.220
That's one crazy way to eat it...

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.450
Oh, that's right...

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.590
If you try eating it with 
the Woolstar Sauce fruit...

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.360
Delicious!

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.330
Me, too!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:33.530
Yum!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:36.270
The taste is deeper, and more fulfilling!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:42.510
He ate the entire thing himself!

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.740
Komatsu, can you get some 
ginger from the Ginger Box?

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:46.880
This?

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:47.810
Yeah, that.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:50.980
We'll eat ginger that can erase the taste 
of the previous meal while we walk,

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.690
resetting the palate for the next place.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.150
Here.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.360
Thank you.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.630
Nice of them to provide it for free.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.390
Yup!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.130
Let's head on to the next one!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:03.930
Right!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:06.630
Here's your Underbite Ramen!

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.230
Thanks for the food!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.440
Delicious...

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.610
Smooth and slick noodles,

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:21.510
and a thick soup made from 
an Underbite Dragon...

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.350
Delicious indeed, Toriko-san!

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:25.850
Another!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:26.780
Here.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:28.920
One more!

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:29.950
Here.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:31.860
One more!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.590
Here.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.420
He's treating it like one bite-soba...

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.290
That'll be 5,250,000...

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.400
5-5,250,000?!

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.460
Put it on my card.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.170
We'll do sushi next, Komatsu!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:43.600
R-Right!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.500
It's truly the bounty of the sea, you know?

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.710
This place has the biggest sushi 
portions in all of Gourmet Town!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.280
Sure, great...

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:56.310
Can I have some sushi now?

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.620
That'll be 12,640,000 yen.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.580
He's into 8 figures!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:01.580
Put it on my card.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.650
Man, my stomach's finally woken up!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.790
Let's really get started!

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:11.590
Each day, over 25,000,000 people 
are customers at Gourmet Town!

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.760
And that's today's Gourmet News.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.070
Good job, Tina-kun.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.100
Chief?

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:23.470
It seems you still haven't returned 
our station's camera you borrowed...

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.470
Not only did you take off on your 
own and fail to get a scoop,

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.080
you also lost a camera!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.480
The camera, well...

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.410
It kinda broke...

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:36.120
It broke?! Well, that's 
definitely a problem...

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.450
He came here just to yell at me?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.220
He's super-sized pissing me off!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.490
The mic picked that all up.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.960
Oopsie, I pissed her off.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.230
What a beautiful machine!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.940
And my beautiful piloting!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.940
Yes! This is wonderful!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.310
Brother, where are you?

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:01.880
Rin! I'm heading to the healing country.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.950
Well, I'm taking that helicopter 
to go play at Toriko's house!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.710
So get back here!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:09.480
But this is my beautiful Mach helicopter!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:15.220
And Toriko's probably off on 
some journey eating something!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:19.530
These Grand King Octopus takoyaki 
are crispy on the outside,

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:22.260
creamy on the inside, and so delicious!

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.360
Gourmet Hunters?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.830
There are a lot of them looking for action...

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.570
Along with that guy from 
before... Is something up?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.640
Looks like those guys got in, too.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:38.140
Oh yeah, why did you come to Gourmet Town?

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.310
I'm meeting up with a certain someone.

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:42.150
I've still got a little bit of time.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.850
In that case, I have some 
place I'd like to go.

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.220
What? A Gourmet Department Store?

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:51.420
I don't care about places that 
don't have something to eat.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.190
It's a Kuribo Pot!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:58.300
That's a pot that won't warp even 
if heated to 1000s of degrees!

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:01.500
This Gourmet Spicer's come 
out with a new version!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.130
It's Melk Knives!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.700
Original kitchen knives 
from Master Craftsman Melk!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.570
You're like a kid in a candy shop...

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.140
Why don't you just buy it?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.210
I can't! The cheapest one is 1,000,000 yen...

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:15.180
For me, that's...

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.820
I think I'll take them all.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.180
As you wish!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.090
W-What?

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.020
And I'll take one each of those Kuribo pots.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.890
Plus that, and this...

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.960
And one of everything on that side.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:32.360
Whoa... That's some pricey shopping!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.800
The wealthy can't help 
buying things in droves...

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.770
Anyway, we should get going.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.640
But I still have something I'd like to see.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:39.900
Hurry up already.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:40.640
Right!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.080
Hold it!

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.610
A Gourmet robber gang?

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:49.610
Hold it!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:57.520
Stay back or the kid gets it!

00:13:58.990 --> 00:13:59.990
Komatsu!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.470
Don't get any closer!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.540
Get back!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.540
Hey!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.010
Let him go.

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:20.080
Stop! Don't you care what happens to him?

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.150
I gotta get going or I'm gonna be late.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.850
Toriko-san, you're more worried about 
your appointment than my life?!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.280
So cruel...

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:31.020
Toriko? You mean Gourmet Hunter Toriko?!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.820
Crap, this is bad.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:33.890
Let's scram!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.360
Hey, wait!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:40.760
I said wait!

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:44.270
Our motto is to never let go 
of what we got our hands on!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.900
Hold it, you!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.440
Why, you slippery little...

00:14:58.650 --> 00:14:59.750
It's Toriko!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.880
Toriko!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.950
Toriko!

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.220
Damn...

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.660
I know this place like the back of my hand.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.530
Move it!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.640
My, oh my... What troubled times.

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:23.200
Oww...

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.400
You okay?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.710
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.570
Komatsu!

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.240
G-Granny S-Setsu?!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.850
You're late, Toriko.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:34.680
The preparations are all finished.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.450
Granny Setsu?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.990
I'm sorry. As you can see, we got 
caught up in a little incident.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.190
Toriko-san, this is...?

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.830
Yup. You're a chef, so I'm sure you know her.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.390
Don't tell me...

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:52.370
Yup. One of only four in the world...

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.470
A Gourmet Living National Treasure...

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.970
N-No way...

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:01.040
The legendary chef... Setsuno-sama...

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:06.180
Now now, you... No need to add the -sama.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.950
Just call me Setsuno.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.450
She's treating me like we're best friends!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.420
No, no!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.620
I can't address a Gourmet Living National 
Treasure like someone my status...

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.390
Who the hell said you're my status?! 
You should know your place!

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:18.990
That's the issue?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.230
Don't worry about it, Komatsu.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.590
Call her Granny Setsu.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.560
Toriko. You're looking a bit unkempt...

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:27.670
Huh? But I made sure to wear a suit...

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.300
That'll do.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.840
What's this?!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.170
Proper attention to grooming 
starts from the feet up.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.770
But this's my head!

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.670
And what's with this hairstyle?

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.310
It's totally my type... I 
think I might fall in love...

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.880
Please, stop!

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.380
I have no intention of 
making food for someone

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.350
who doesn't have proper respect 
for food and clothing!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.790
Today's appointment is canceled!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.820
I apologize. How is this?

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:54.190
You're a pretty fine looking man, Toriko.

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:56.290
And you're not a bad looking 
lady yourself, Granny Setsu...

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.960
Your features are fine to the max!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.600
What is this...

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:03.670
I need to do a little shopping.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.570
What are you grinning about, Komatsu-kun?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.810
But, this is Setsuno-san!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:13.840
The first person to breed Light Eels, and 
remove the poison from a Puffer Whale.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.550
To be able to meet Setsuno-san,

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.510
who accomplished so many 
great culinary triumphs...

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.480
Not only that, but we're 
heading to her restaurant!

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.550
I'm impressed you got a reservation.

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:23.850
I've waited for 4 years.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.890
4 years?!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.720
Yeah.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.690
Because she only opens 
her place once a month.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.330
It's not once a month, it's 
whenever I feel like it!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.860
When you feel like it?!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:42.000
Oh! You're a chef?

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:42.810
Yes!

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:46.040
I'm the head chef of Hotel Gourmet.

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.940
IGO's hotel, huh?

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:50.910
Is Ichi-chan doing well?

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.280
I-Ichi-chan?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.250
The president of the IGO.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.820
The president?!

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:59.720
He's an old friend of Granny Setsu.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.320
We were so naughty back when we were young...

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.760
I often hear about the 
greatest Gourmet Hunters

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:11.570
searching for great chefs to 
pair up with, and vice versa...

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.640
The president was a famous Gourmet 
Hunter when he was young.

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:19.670
So, was the chef he paired 
with you, Setsuno-san?

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.080
Not at all.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.810
Oh, totally wrong.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:27.380
The one I paired with was a man named Jiro.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.180
J-Jiro?! You don't mean...

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:30.820
Knocking Master Jiro?

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.290
Oh, you know him?

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.420
Know him?

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:38.430
My life was saved by Jiro-san.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.090
Was it now?

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:46.470
We were a team for a long time. 
He'd catch it, and I'd cook it.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.440
The two of us went to the Gourmet World.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.570
We even fell in love.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:55.270
So that's why you made my hair like this.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:19:00.150
And Jiro saved your life, huh?

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:11.920
Your restaurant is quite far away 
from the center of the city.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:15.530
There are plenty of chain stores where 
Granny Setsu is the owner in town.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.530
I bet you're embarrassed with 
all those Setsunon dolls...

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:23.800
Granny Setsu's stores make just as much 
money as the Gourmet Tower, you know.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:24.940
Wow!

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:25.940
We're here!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.810
This is my restaurant!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.240
S-So huge!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.810
It's like a castle!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.780
As expected from the restaurant of a 
Gourmet Living National Treasure...

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.950
Hurry on up, Komatsu!

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:39.280
I-It's over there?!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.990
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.600
"Shiin" means that she's getting ready.

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:55.100
"Whaa!" means she's making 
money hand over fist.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:59.040
Does "Whaa!" really mean 
something that vulgar?!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.310
Come on, let's go, people.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.740
Pardon the intru...

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:07.380
Huh?

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.810
It's pitch black.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:09.880
Setsuno-san?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.920
It's been 6 months since 
I closed the store...

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.220
The light bulbs burnt out.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:23.930
Welcome to Setsuno's Diner.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.860
It's normal...

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.600
The tables...

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.270
The stools...

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:33.740
Even the cooking utensils are 
the kind you can find anywhere.

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:37.370
Serving the ultimate dishes 
with everyday tools...

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.740
That's Granny Setsu.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.510
Wow!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:42.510
Just amazing!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.720
Have a seat, customers.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.650
I've got a special menu for you today!

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:50.420
Yeah!

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.720
S-Special menu?

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:53.960
Sit down, Komatsu.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:54.960
Right.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:59.860
No matter what happens, 
do not leave that seat!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.560
Even if a meteor is falling!

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.930
That won't stop us from eating this meal!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.470
Then, have a taste!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:12.740
The Legendary Soup, Century Soup!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.710
Century Soup...

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:30.120
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:36.400
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:43.640
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:48.580
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:53.680
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:57.050
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:01.520
on a journey with no end!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:06.490
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:09.630
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:15.640
amid the waves of time.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:20.510
Gourmet News!

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:23.110
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:26.480
Toriko smacked his lips with this 
Gourmet Fatty Tuna in Gourmet Town!

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:29.980
There's a way to experience 
this taste at home!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:33.250
First, cut up an avocado 
to about the right size.

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.450
Then dip it in wasabi and soy sauce.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:36.690
And then...

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:39.830
It's fatty tuna!

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:42.160
The taste of perfect Gourmet Fatty Tuna!

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:44.860
If you add nori or mayonnaise 
to your taste...

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:48.970
It's a different flavor, 
but wonderful as well!

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.140
If you add sea urchin roe, 
salmon roe, and caviar...

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:56.210
This is the best!

00:22:56.570 --> 00:22:58.280
Can you get me some Tupperware?

00:22:58.280 --> 00:23:01.050
I'd like to take home the extra sea 
urchin roe, salmon roe, and caviar.

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:04.280
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.780
Chef Komatsu, how does the legendary soup taste?

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:13.560
Come on, Komatsu-kun, answer me! What’s wrong with you?

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.960
Dreamtime! Setsuno's Century Soup!

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:19.180
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
